lines:
Prof. Cozmo: Oh...
I never should have let myself be{be00}
conned into telling Team Aqua where{be00}
you can find Meteorites...{be01}
That Meteorite from Meteor Falls...
It’s never going to be mine now...

Oh!
Hah?{be01}
That item...{be01}
Could it be?{be01}
Is it the Meteorite that Team Aqua
took from Meteor Falls?{be01}
Please, may I have it?{be01}
I’m not asking for it for free.
How about in exchange for this TM?

Prof. Cozmo: Oh, {0100:0}! I heard
you became the Champion!{be01}
A colleague of mine studies the places
where meteorites fall.{be01}
He sent me this ticket for a ship to
Birth Island, a faraway island where{be00}
something fell from the sky long ago…{be01}
I’m too old for sea voyages.
Please, go in my place!
